{
  // Typecheck for scripts/. The root tsconfig includes only src/ and test/, so scripts/ had
  // NEVER been typechecked by `npm run audit` — 43 .mjs plus 7 .mts/.ts files, including
  // publish-flip.mjs, publish-flip-verify.mjs, cutover.mjs and predeploy-gate.ts. The most
  // safety-critical code in the repo was the code CI never compiled.
  //
  // WIDENED 2026-08-02 from four files to every .mts/.ts under scripts/. The narrow scope was
  // justified above by "the other scripts/*.mts and predeploy-gate.ts carry pre-existing errors
  // (an implicit `any` in predeploy-gate.ts among them)" — measured, that had gone stale:
  // predeploy-gate.ts is clean, and the only file that errored was publish-flip-adjudicate.mts,
  // at exactly the three positions where it passed `undefined` for §2/§3/§4 of the census.
  //
  // That is the point of this file existing. Two audit lenses graded the one-leg A3 adjudication
  // CRITICAL, a third downgraded it, and a session went into arguing about it — while `tsc` had
  // the answer the whole time and nothing ran it:
  //     136:44  TS2322  Type 'undefined' is not assignable to type 'ForbiddenExposure'
  //     136:66  TS2322  Type 'undefined' is not assignable to type 'VoiceFloor'
  //     136:85  TS2322  Type 'undefined' is not assignable to type 'Serving'
  //
  // STILL NOT COVERED, deliberately, and tracked rather than implied: the 43 `scripts/*.mjs`
  // files. Compiling those needs `allowJs`/`checkJs`, which is its own slice — and with it the
  // second-order gap the audit named, that the 13 hand-written `scripts/lib/*.d.mts` files are
  // validated against nothing, so a signature drift between a declaration and its `.mjs` is
  // green in tsc and only surfaces at runtime.
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    // The gate imports web/src/lib/teacher/routing.ts and web/src/lib/legal-corpus.ts
    // directly and runs under `npx tsx`, which resolves .ts specifiers as written.
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true
  },
  "include": [
    "scripts/**/*.mts",
    "scripts/**/*.ts",
    "scripts/lib/*.d.mts",
    "web/src/lib/teacher/routing.ts",
    "web/src/lib/legal-corpus.ts"
  ]
}
